                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Dot has turned her\nnotebook into an\noperating rule.\nThe clerk gives",
                                  "her the good\npencil, worn\nalmost to the\neraser. It is a\nsmall",
                                  "inheritance of\nresponsibility.\nDot accepts\nwithout a speech\nand",
                                  "immediately uses\nit to label the\nbackup path."
                                ],
